{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"axe_war","model_identifier":"axe_war","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"## axe_war\n\nOne-handed weapon, copper.\n\n- Cubes: 7 (0 rotated). Texture 32x32, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -1.0..1.0, y -10.0..1.5, z -25.8..4.0 (size 2.0 x 11.5 x 29.8 u = 6 x 32 x 84 cm).\nCopper bearded war axe, about 72 cm: socketed head whose lower blade (\"beard\") hooks back along the haft, leather grip. Grip at the origin, head 21-26 u forward (-Z), edge down (-Y) and forward. One-handed.\n- Embedded texture: copper (the only metal tier). Flint version: `axe_war_flint.bbmodel` (own geometry).\n\n- Variant textures (same UV layout): `axe_war_copper.png`\n"},"description":"## axe_war\n\nOne-handed weapon, copper.\n\n- Cubes: 7 (0 rotated). Texture 32x32, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -1.0..1.0, y -10.0..1.5, z -25.8..4.0 (size 2.0 x 11.5 x 29.8 u = 6 x 32 x 84 cm).\nCopper bearded war axe, about 72 cm: socketed head whose lower blade (\"beard\") hooks back along the haft, leather grip. Grip at the origin, head 21-26 u forward (-Z), edge down (-Y) and forward. One-handed.\n- Embedded texture: copper (the only metal tier). Flint version: `axe_war_flint.bbmodel` (own geometry).\n\n- Variant textures (same UV layout): `axe_war_copper.png`\n","resolution":{"width":32,"height":64},"elements":[{"name":"handle","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-0.5,-0.75,-22.0],"to":[0.5,0.75,3.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[29,30,30.0,31.5],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[0,28,25.0,29.5],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[30,30,31.0,31.5],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[0,30,25.0,31.5],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[0,0,1.0,25.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[1,0,2.0,25.